---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';

const lang = 'en' as const;
---

<Layout
  title="Support | Voltline System"
  description="Technical support for Voltline System, the web platform, and the iOS and Android mobile applications."
  lang={lang}
>
  <Navbar lang={lang} />

  <main id="main-content" class="py-16 md:py-20">
    <section class="container-shell">
      <article class="mx-auto max-w-4xl rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7 shadow-card md:p-10">
        <p class="eyebrow">Help and contact</p>
        <h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-5xl leading-[0.92] text-dark md:text-6xl">Voltline System support</h1>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600">We support authorized organization users working with Voltline System on the web, iPhone, and Android.</p>

        <div class="policy-content mt-8 space-y-6">
          <h2>Support contact</h2>
          <p>Email <a href="mailto:contacto@voltline.cl?subject=Voltline%20System%20Support">contacto@voltline.cl</a>. Include your organization name, app version, the approximate time of the issue, and the request identifier if one is displayed.</p>

          <h2>Access issues</h2>
          <p>Accounts are assigned by each organization. If you cannot sign in or your role is incorrect, contact your company administrator first. Voltline will never request your full password by email.</p>

          <h2>Synchronization and offline work</h2>
          <p>The app may temporarily save progress on the device and synchronize it when connectivity returns. If an operation remains pending, do not sign out or remove the app; send support the approximate time and the status shown on the synchronization screen.</p>

          <h2>Privacy</h2>
          <p>Read the <a href="/en/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a> to learn which data is processed, why it is processed, which technology providers are involved, and how to exercise your rights.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer lang={lang} />
</Layout>
